pt;\">58</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">회 발명의 날 기념식</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">을 개최할 예정이오니 유관기관 및 관련자가 포상 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">추천</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">행&nbsp; 사&nbsp; 명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">58</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">회 발명의 날 기념식</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">행사내용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">우수발명가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">발명유공자 및 단체에 대한 포상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">올해의 발명왕 시상</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">포상계획 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">훈</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">˙</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">포장 등 정부포상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">정부기관장 표창 등</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청기한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: '23.1.2.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) ~ 2.3.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) 18:00 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;＊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">올해의 발명왕</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">의 경우 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">'23.2.10.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) 18:00 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">까지 접수 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;＊＊ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">접수마감 당일 온라인 신청 접수에 한함</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-